Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qcom: load explicit module configurations safely

Allow effect widgets and complete topology-supplied module parameters. Correct
the private-array length, reject malformed parameter records and propagate
widget load failures. OEM data takes precedence over generated defaults.

--- a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/topology.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/topology.c
@@ -220,7 +220,7 @@
